fields.value:
 {{Spellunit
| innate = true;1;1
| name = Eidolon
| desc0 = The Eidolons always spawn in the same formation, {{#var:Demonic Summoning basic1}}-distance from the point-targeted location 0° facing east, to its right, left, and backside.

| icon1 = T0
| type1 = tal
| target1 = Passive
| desc1 = The Eidolons' main purpose is to help Enigma destablize the equibrilium in the quickest possible way.

| type1 trait1 = Attack Speed Bonus;t1r
| type1 value1 tal = {{Show|T|Enigma|v1r}}
| type1 trait2 = Attack Damage Bonus;t3l
| type1 value2 tal = {{Show|T|Enigma|v3l}}
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** {{Symbol|hp cost}}
*** The {{M|current health}} cost utilizes [[setting health]] and is non-lethal.
**** Hence, this ability can be cast when Enigma has less than the required current health.

* The created {{U|Eidolon}} has three main properties:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|21px|1]] {{Symbol|Health}}
*** The created unit's [[health]] is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Unit Max[[Health|HP]] {{=}} {{Show|U|Eidolon|health}} + [[Wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌊]] EnigmaCurrent[[Health|HP]] × {{#var:Demonic Summoning type1 value1}} [[Wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌋]]}}
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|21px|2]] {{Symbol|Summons}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{Symbol|Tally}} {{Symbol|Tally|1}}
*** The first Eidolons created by casting Demonic Summoning multiply upon launching their '''{{#var:Demonic Summoning type2 value1}}th''' attack.
*** {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** The tally '''only''' increases upon the Eidolon's {{M|attack point}} while attacking the following valid enemy units:
***** Heroes
***** {{M|Clones}}
***** {{M|Creep-heroes}}
***** Creeps of all types.
***** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
**** Does not tally attacks on the following units:
***** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
***** {{M|Buildings}}
*** The '''{{#var:Demonic Summoning type2 value1}}th''' attack attempt creates new Eidolons regardless if the attack is applied onto the aformentioned valid enemy units.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|21px|3]] {{to}} {{Symbol|Summons}} {{Symbol|Summons}}
*** Applies the following ability effects on the remaining Eidolons upon multiplying:
***# All current Eidolons' health are [[Setting Health|set]] to 100% {{M|current health}}.
***#* This neither {{M|dispels}} nor {{M|disjoints}} incoming {{M|projectiles}}.
***# Creates the second batch of non-multiplying Eidolon corresponding to the current ability values, following component [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|21px|1]] .
***# Both batches of Eidolons' current duration is now defined as:
***#* {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Duration {{=}} First[[Eidolon]] RemainingDuration + {{#var:Demonic Summoning type3 value1}}}}
***# The multiplied Eidolons still attack the same target prior to being multiplied.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Demonic Summoning icon0}}
| desc = Summons three fragments of Enigma himself at the cost of health.  The eidolons health is increased by 3% of Enigma's current health. These eidolons are all under Enigma's control, and repeated successful attacks cause them to multiply.  When this happens, the eidolons have their health restored.
}}
* The {{U|Eidolon|text=Eidolons}} have the following additional properties:
** [[File:Dota2 Enigma Eidolon Formation.png|84px|Demonic Summoning Formation]]
*** Creates three groups of Eidolon(s) at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] , point [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] , and point [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|21px|S]] respectively.
**** Point [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|21px|F]] is the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted location.
**** Line {{Code|PQ}} forms a straight line.
**** {{Code|FP {{=}} FQ {{=}} FS {{=}} {{#var:Demonic Summoning basic1}}}}
*** {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||number of Eidolons increasing|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4l}} still creates three groups of Eidolons in the same formation.
**** Both point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] and point [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] each have {{ValueColor||3|25tal}} Eidolons, while point [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|21px|S]] has {{ValueColor||2|25tal}} Eidolons.
** {{cf|Cos}}
*** The unit's name progresses as follows per Demonic Summoning level:
**** Lessor Eidolon {{to}} Eidolon {{to}} Greater Eidolon {{to}} Dire Eidolon
*** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**** Eidolons are created immediately regardless of its spawn animations with {{Cl|ability|Enigma Demonic Summoning|Geodesic Eidolon}} equipped.

